    "title": "SQL Data Grid",
    "description": "Supabase and Neon inspired keyboard-navigable micro data table with SQL column type badges (UUID, VARCHAR, BOOLEAN, TIMESTAMPTZ, JSONB), double-click inline cell editing, and SQL INSERT export.",
